window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I put my treacherous fated mates in their place:</p> <p>My bed<br> A jail cell<br> Their grave</p> <p>That should have been the end of it, but of course, Luame never would’ve given me soulmates who took it lying down.</p> <p>I have a war to fight on all fronts, but it’s the war for my heart that I’m losing—badly.</p> <p>Life has never been more dangerous. The fate of Wolf Nation and millions of lives rests on my shoulders. I don’t have time for love!</p> <p>Do you believe me?</p> <p>No?</p> <p>Yeah, those hot alpha bastards don’t either.</p> <p>Moon Cursed is the second book in the Corvin Academy trilogy. This book features spicy spice, language, and fierce wolves who never surrender.</p>"; 
